<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices - May 15.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices - May 15.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST   180 CST     MDO     GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	    96/97    103/104     UNQ     187/189</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	  102/103   108/109   190/193   200/205</p>
<p>--------</p>
<p>COMMENTS - Singapore bunker suppliers maintained their firm levels on Thursday to reflect the strength in the cargo market, traders said. However, shipowners stayed on the sidelines and traders said many have turned to other ports which offer cheaper prices.   -- Singapore Newsroom (65-870-3571)</p>
